      <h3 class="project-title">Regenerative Braking System Optimization</h3>
      <p class="project-desc">
        Modeled vehicle braking forces and applied <strong style="color:var(--text)">Pontryagin's Minimum Principle</strong> to solve an optimal energy control problem. Validated through Python simulations using Euler's method and Bang-Bang control signals — a study in applied optimal control theory.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-card fade-up">
      <div class="project-num">02</div>
      <div class="project-stack">
        <span class="stack-tag">SQL Server</span>
        <span class="stack-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="stack-tag">Database Design</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="project-title">Interplanetary Supply Station ORION-7</h3>
      <p class="project-desc">
        Designed and implemented a comprehensive SQL database system to manage the complex logistics, personnel, and interplanetary operations of an <strong style="color:var(--text)">autonomous orbital station</strong> set in 2149. Complex schema design, relational modeling, and query optimization.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
